                                "sense_id": "0af1213d-df0c-3312-8edf-41ed527e199d",
                                "text": "We have thus returned, then, to that conceptualism of the middle age, which, concentrating truth within the human intelligence, makes the nature of things a phantom of intelligence projecting itself everywhere out of itself[…]"
